{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:40:57+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:40:57+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"VAT Group AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Switzerland","city":"Solothurn","website":"https://www.vatgroup.com","employees":3959,"summary":"VAT Group AG, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the development, manufacture, and sale of vacuum and gas inlet valves, multi-valve modules, motion components, and edge-welded metal bellows. It operates in two segments, Valves and Global Service. The Valves segment offers vacuum valves for the semiconductor, displays, photovoltaics, and vacuum coating industries, as well as for the industrial and research sectors. The Global Service segment provides spare parts, repairs, and upgrades, as well as support services. The company offers vacuum isolation, gate, angle, inline, check, cylinder, and all-metal valves; vacuum pendulum and butterfly valves; 3 position, multi-value, and vacuum control valves; vacuum transfer valves and doors; pressure relief/venting, gas dosing, and fast closing/beam stopper valves; and flange connections, bellows, and vacuum modules. It has operations in Switzerland, rest of Europe, the United States, Japan, Korea, Singapore, China, rest of Asia, and internationally. VAT Group AG was founded in 1965 and is headquartered in Solothurn, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"VAT Group AG, avec ses filiales, se consacre au développement, à la fabrication et à la vente de vannes d'aspiration et d'admission de gaz, de modules à plusieurs soupapes, de composants de mouvement et de soufflets métalliques soudés sur les bords. Elle opère dans deux segments, Valves et Global Service. Le segment Valves propose des vannes à vide pour les industries des semi-conducteurs, des écrans, du photovoltaïque et des revêtements sous vide, ainsi que pour les secteurs industriel et de la recherche."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":17944195072,"shares_outstanding":29966926,"trailing_pe":87.41606,"forward_pe":31.622675,"price_to_book":26.16904,"ev_to_ebitda":67.419,"ev_to_revenue":17.719,"dividend_yield":0.0117,"payout_ratio":1.013,"beta_yahoo":1.484},"targets":{"current_price":598.8,"mean":742.1177,"median":790.0,"high":933.0,"low":400.0,"n_analysts":17,"reco_mean":2.11111,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":[],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":379000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-30","dividend_date":"2025-05-06"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.100889996,"institutions_pct":0.47237,"institutions_float_pct":0.52537,"institutions_n":456,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":89,"value":53293,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.38619998},{"name":"Stanley-Laman Group, Ltd.","pct":0.0,"shares":1435,"value":859277,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.80730003}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.013300001,"shares":397864,"value":238240958,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0092},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0088,"shares":263709,"value":157908945,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0116},{"name":"New Economy Fund","pct":0.0073,"shares":219376,"value":131362346,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0397},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0068,"shares":204545,"value":122481543,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0139},{"name":"SmallCap World Fund Inc","pct":0.0061000003,"shares":182276,"value":109146866,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":-0.1259},{"name":"Fidelity Concord Street Trust-Fidelity International Index Fund","pct":0.0034999999,"shares":105824,"value":63367409,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.008},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0032,"shares":96220,"value":57616534,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Intl Gr